{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は2016年8月21日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が結成されてから、\n5年の月日が経ちました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5周年、おめでとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年前は、私は中学3年生の14歳。\nそして今は、大学2年生の19歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学の半年間、\n高校三年間、\n大学一年と半年間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう挙げると長く感じるかもしれないけど\n私には短く感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年間、中学生の私には想像も出来ないような\n普通の学生では出来ないような\n素晴らしい経験を数え切れないほど\n沢山させていただいています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難いことです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この環境に感謝をして、\nこれからも前を向いて、\n活動していきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、6年目の私達も\n宜しくお願いしますm(_ _)m！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の写真を載せようと思ったけど\n中学生の頃の写真は携帯を変えてまって\n残ってないから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校一年生の中3組。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/21/9087260/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼い気がする〜\n若い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今の私達！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/21/9087260/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/21/9087260/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは大人になったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また3人で撮ったら載せます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂の詩」乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどうしても聞きたくなる。\nこの曲を聞くとデビューの時や\nオーディションの事を思い出す。\n歌詞が私達にぴったりで\n胸に強く響いてきます。\nもう一度また頑張ろう、\n前を向いていこう、\nという思いにさせてくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「後ろを向くな正面を見ろ\n自分を信じて前へ進むんだ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6年目はもっと上へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}